{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Glitch and Glory: Tales of Honeywood</i> is a hilarious parody of classic MMORPGs, inspired by the humor of <i>Epic NPC Man</i> from Viva La Dirt League and the absurdity of classic fantasy. Dive into the ridiculous world of Honeywood, where you, a hapless adventurer, tackle absurd quests, battle NPC bureaucracy, and try not to mess everything up. Save sheep, fight spiders (or puppies?), negotiate with ghosts, and dodge fines from the Order of Paladins of Alderkeep. Expect sarcastic dialogue, unexpected twists, and a ton of nods to MMO culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the village of Honeywood, where every resident\u2014from garlic farmer Greg to pompous wizard Baradun\u2014is ready to throw a bizarre task your way. Read (or skip) instructions, choose between an axe or a broom, and try not to become the town\u2019s laughingstock. Can you survive this chaotic world where even a chicken can get you in trouble with the whole village?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MMORPG Parody</strong>: Satire on quests, NPCs, and gaming clich\u00e9s packed with humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices with Consequences</strong>: Your decisions impact reputation and outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd Characters</strong>: Meet the bureaucratic Quartermaster, philosophical gravediggers, and enigmatic Priestess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Achievements</strong>: Earn rewards for persistence (or sheer stupidity).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Style</strong>: Classic pixel art and dialogue in the spirit of RPG Maker MZ.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>References and Easter Eggs</strong>: Nods to famous fantasy novels, MMORPGs, and other iconic games and worlds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re ready to laugh at yourself and the absurdity of MMORPGs, <i>Glitch and Glory</i> is your ticket to an absurd adventure!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877120?t=1756408450","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877120/6e11ffdf884f41bb1b2dc93ab69f705d84161f48/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756408450","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877120/7d7cc5f610e67f7dff95b4d4f6a186e56ce0bc54/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756408450","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877120/7d7cc5f610e67f7dff95b4d4f6a186e56ce0bc54/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756408450","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"\"Glitch and Glory: Tales of Honeywood\" includes light stylized violence (battles with NPC and monsters in pixel art style), as well as mentions of alcohol consumption and smoking. The game does not contain sexual content, detailed graphic violence, sexual violence, drug abuse, or self-harm. Some quests may feature sarcastic humor that might not suit all players. The content may evolve based on community feedback.\r\n\r\nNote from the developer: I\u2019m making a good old fantasy game, not what you might have thought!"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Glitch and Glory: Tales of Honeywood</i> is a hilarious parody of classic MMORPGs, inspired by the humor of <i>Epic NPC Man</i> from Viva La Dirt League and the absurdity of classic fantasy. Dive into the ridiculous world of Honeywood, where you, a hapless adventurer, tackle absurd quests, battle NPC bureaucracy, and try not to mess everything up. Save sheep, fight spiders (or puppies?), negotiate with ghosts, and dodge fines from the Order of Paladins of Alderkeep. Expect sarcastic dialogue, unexpected twists, and a ton of nods to MMO culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the village of Honeywood, where every resident\u2014from garlic farmer Greg to pompous wizard Baradun\u2014is ready to throw a bizarre task your way. Read (or skip) instructions, choose between an axe or a broom, and try not to become the town\u2019s laughingstock. Can you survive this chaotic world where even a chicken can get you in trouble with the whole village?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MMORPG Parody</strong>: Satire on quests, NPCs, and gaming clich\u00e9s packed with humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices with Consequences</strong>: Your decisions impact reputation and outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd Characters</strong>: Meet the bureaucratic Quartermaster, philosophical gravediggers, and enigmatic Priestess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Achievements</strong>: Earn rewards for persistence (or sheer stupidity).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Style</strong>: Classic pixel art and dialogue in the spirit of RPG Maker MZ.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>References and Easter Eggs</strong>: Nods to famous fantasy novels, MMORPGs, and other iconic games and worlds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re ready to laugh at yourself and the absurdity of MMORPGs, <i>Glitch and Glory</i> is your ticket to an absurd adventure!</p>","developers":["Victoria Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"